WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:08.674 --> 00:00:12.178
- LANDO! WHAT?
OH, SNAP!

00:00:12.211 --> 00:00:13.780
YO, LANDO!

00:00:13.813 --> 00:00:15.181
YO, LANDO CALRISSIAN!

00:00:15.214 --> 00:00:16.582
- OH, HI.
YEAH, THAT'S ME.

00:00:16.615 --> 00:00:20.153
- OH...DUDE!
LANDO!

00:00:20.186 --> 00:00:24.290
YO! YO, YOU STRAIGHT UP RUNNING
CLOUD CITY RIGHT NOW, DOG!

00:00:24.323 --> 00:00:25.391
- [chuckles]
- THAT'S YOU, MAN!

00:00:25.424 --> 00:00:26.392
YOU OUT THERE JUST--

00:00:26.425 --> 00:00:28.161
[imitates ship engine whirring,
laser blasts]

00:00:28.194 --> 00:00:28.962
SWOOSH!

00:00:28.995 --> 00:00:31.297
- WELL, YOU KNOW,
I-I DO MY BEST.

00:00:31.330 --> 00:00:34.067
- ZEEF, MAN. ZEEF HOWDO.
BIG FAN, BIG FAN.

00:00:34.100 --> 00:00:37.070
- WELL, ZEEF, IT'S REAL NICE
TO MAKE YOUR ACQUAINTANCE.

00:00:37.103 --> 00:00:38.304
- STRAIGHT UP, THOUGH--
STRAIGHT UP, MAN.

00:00:38.337 --> 00:00:40.573
YOU AN INSPIRATION
TO ALL OF US, MAN.

00:00:40.606 --> 00:00:43.509
YOU INSP--YOU'RE THE REASON
I'M OUT HERE IN CLOUD CITY, DOG.

00:00:43.542 --> 00:00:44.777
MAN, I AIN'T EVEN JOKING, MAN.
- THAT'S NICE.

00:00:44.810 --> 00:00:46.446
- BUT, YO, IDEALLY, THOUGH?
- YEAH?

00:00:46.479 --> 00:00:49.215
- IDEALLY--
ON AN IDEAL SITUATION,

00:00:49.248 --> 00:00:50.550
I WOULD BE DOING
LIKE WHAT YOU'RE DOING.

00:00:50.583 --> 00:00:52.418
I'D BE UP THERE, LIKE,
IN THE HIGH CHAMBERS

00:00:52.451 --> 00:00:53.719
OF CLOUD CITY, DOG.

00:00:53.752 --> 00:00:55.221
- WELL, ZEEF,
IT'S NICE TO MEET YOU.

00:00:55.254 --> 00:00:56.589
- YO, RIGHT ON, MAN,

00:00:56.622 --> 00:00:58.191
'CAUSE THEY GOT ME
IN THE CARBONITE ROOM

00:00:58.224 --> 00:00:59.225
RIGHT NOW, SON.

00:00:59.258 --> 00:01:00.326
THAT'S BULL[bleep], RIGHT?

00:01:00.359 --> 00:01:02.728
THEY GOT ME WORKING
WITH SOME PIG DUDES AND WHATNOT.

00:01:02.761 --> 00:01:04.564
YO, I AIN'T NO PIG,
YOU KNOW?

00:01:04.597 --> 00:01:05.698
AND YOU EVER NOTICE, MAN,

00:01:05.732 --> 00:01:08.734
THERE AIN'T A LOT OF BROTHERS
OUT HERE, MAN, IN SPACE.

00:01:08.767 --> 00:01:10.736
RIGHT? IT'S LIKE THEY'RE
TRYING TO KEEP US DOWN, MAN.

00:01:10.769 --> 00:01:13.673
- YOU KNOW, I-I DON'T THINK
THAT IT'S THE POLICY.

00:01:13.706 --> 00:01:16.309
I JUST THINK IT'S
REALLY, REALLY DIFFICULT

00:01:16.342 --> 00:01:17.810
TO GET TO THIS LEVEL.

00:01:17.843 --> 00:01:21.647
YOU'VE GOT TO UNDERSTAND
THE POLITICS OF THE EMPIRE

00:01:21.680 --> 00:01:22.615
AND, AT THE SAME TIME,

00:01:22.648 --> 00:01:24.350
ALL THE MOTIVATIONS
OF THE REBEL ALLIANCE.

00:01:24.383 --> 00:01:25.484
- ALL THAT, MAN, ALL THAT.
- YOU'VE GOT--

00:01:25.518 --> 00:01:27.353
- ALL THAT, ALL THAT,
ALL THAT, ALL THAT, ALL THAT.

00:01:27.386 --> 00:01:29.155
BUT IDEALLY, THOUGH, MAN?

00:01:29.188 --> 00:01:31.657
IDEALLY, WHAT I'M TALKING
ABOUT IS, LIKE, ME AND YOU--

00:01:31.690 --> 00:01:34.293
WE SHOULD, LIKE, DO SOMETHING
TOGETHER, THOUGH, MAN,

00:01:34.326 --> 00:01:36.629
'CAUSE IF YOU THINK ABOUT IT,
YO, WHEN I WAS YOUNGER, MAN,

00:01:36.662 --> 00:01:38.664
I USED TO FLY THOSE LANDSPEEDERS
ALL THE TIME.

00:01:38.697 --> 00:01:40.666
MY FRIENDS WAS LIKE,
"MAN, YOU SHOULD BE PILOTING

00:01:40.699 --> 00:01:42.502
ONE OF THE X-WINGS,"
RIGHT?

00:01:42.535 --> 00:01:43.836
AND SO THAT'S,
LIKE, DISAPPOINTING, MAN,

00:01:43.869 --> 00:01:45.505
'CAUSE I GOT HERE,
AND THEY JUST HAD ME, LIKE,

00:01:45.538 --> 00:01:47.840
CLEANING UP THE R2 UNITS
AFTER THE X-WINGS COME IN.

00:01:47.873 --> 00:01:49.809
- ZEEF, I GOT TO GO.

00:01:49.842 --> 00:01:51.511
YOU SHOULD PROB--
OH, NO.

00:01:51.544 --> 00:01:53.913
- MAN, I'M SAYING, MAN,
HOW DO WE CONTACT ONE ANOTHER?

00:01:53.946 --> 00:01:54.914
'CAUSE THAT'S
THE MOST IMPORTANT THING--

00:01:54.947 --> 00:01:56.382
THAT WE CONTACT ONE ANOTHER,

00:01:56.415 --> 00:01:58.251
'CAUSE, YO, LOOK, MAN,
IDEALLY, THOUGH?

00:01:58.284 --> 00:01:59.552
IDEALLY THOUGH?

00:01:59.586 --> 00:02:02.288
I WOULD GET TO FLY, SOMEHOW,
LIKE, THE<i> MILLENNIUM FALCON.</i>

00:02:02.321 --> 00:02:03.256
LIKE, THAT WOULD BE COOL.
[device beeps]

00:02:03.289 --> 00:02:05.324
AND, YO, LET ME GET YOU MY--
LIKE, MY CONT--

00:02:05.357 --> 00:02:06.893
I GOT MY CARD
IN HERE SOMEWHERE.

00:02:06.926 --> 00:02:07.794
[beeping]
MAN, I'M JUST TRYING

00:02:07.827 --> 00:02:09.829
TO FIND THIS, LIKE,
POCKET RIGHT HERE,

00:02:09.862 --> 00:02:12.165
'CAUSE THESE--
SOMETIMES, THESE SUITS,

00:02:12.198 --> 00:02:14.300
THEY DON'T GOT NO POCKETS.
- YOU KNOW WHAT, ZEEF?

00:02:14.333 --> 00:02:16.669
JUST GIVE YOUR INFORMATION
TO LOBOT HERE,

00:02:16.702 --> 00:02:18.838
AND WE'LL BE IN TOUCH.

00:02:18.871 --> 00:02:20.173
- LOBOT?

00:02:20.206 --> 00:02:22.308
MAN, I SEE HOW IT IS.

00:02:22.341 --> 00:02:24.377
I GOT TO TALK TO YOUR MANDROID
RIGHT NOW?

00:02:24.410 --> 00:02:26.412
MAN, [bleep] YOU, [bleep]!

00:02:26.445 --> 00:02:27.813
LITTLE WHITE-ASS HAIR!

00:02:27.846 --> 00:02:29.949
WHY YOU WEARING A CAPE,
THOUGH, HUH?

00:02:29.982 --> 00:02:32.285
WHERE YOU GOING,
THE ICE PLANET HOTH?

00:02:32.318 --> 00:02:35.321
- [chuckles]
OUTRAGEOUS.

